WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:07.107 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la guerre.

00:00:05.406 --> 00:00:08.108 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Dans les rues de Lviv,

00:00:06.407 --> 00:00:16.583 size:53% position:73% line:53%
