00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:36.737 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Avant le 1er avrrt,

00:00:35.002 --> 00:00:37.771 size:53% position:73% line:53%
j'étais convaincue que mes amis

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:38.806 size:53% position:73% line:53%
