00:00:41.175 --> 00:00:47.481 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Deux soldats morts dans

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:48.482 size:53% position:73% line:53%
n de Louhansk,

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:54.755 size:53% position:73% line:53%
