00:01:14.742 --> 00:01:26.787 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Sur les visages se liteine.eine.

00:01:20.347 --> 00:01:28.856 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Soyons braves, ne baissons pas

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:29.857 size:53% position:73% line:53%
